    "de": [
      "CAPS bietet Jagd-, Waffen- und Angelausrüstung sowie einen Fahrrad- und Mountainbike-Verleih. Verkauf von Angelscheinen Ardèche."
    ],
    "en": [
      "CAPS offers equipment for hunting, gunsmithing and fishing, as well as bike and mountain bike hire. Ardèche fishing permits on sale."
    ],
    "it": [
      "Il CAPS offre attrezzature per la caccia, l'armeria e la pesca, oltre al noleggio di biciclette e mountain bike. Vendita di permessi di pesca per l'Ardèche."
    ],
    "fr": [
      "CAPS propose des équipements de chasse, armurerie et pêche, ainsi que la location de vélos et VTT. Vente de permis de pêche Ardèche."
    ],
